Error [E0389]: `@N` marks a number parameter with the retired `@` mark.
  --> tests/ui/constgen_at_param_retired.jet:3:15
    |
  3 | struct Packet<@N: Int> {
    |               ^^
 Why: Only the declaration carries `prep`; every use writes the plain name `N`.
 Fix: Write `prep N` in the parameter list.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0389
